    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "Find the missing numbers.\n\n$$\\dfrac{2}{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{4mm}\\hspace{4mm}}}-\\dfrac{1}{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{4mm}\\hspace{4mm}}}=\\dfrac{1}{12}$$",
