    "answer": {
      "short": "For example, $6,\\ 4$ (left to right).",
      "worked": "One possible pair is $6,\\ 4$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{6}-\\frac{1}{4}&=\\frac{4}{12}-\\frac{3}{12}\\\\&=\\frac{1}{12}.\\end{align*}$$",
